ist chooses the Yaggababble, the Yaggababble does not kill tonight."],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:light_purple},"\n\n",{text:"Lil' Monsta",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/ ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Hatter",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If the Hatter dies & the Demon chooses Lil' Monsta, they also choose a Minion to become."],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:light_purple},"\n\n",{text:"Lil' Monsta",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/ ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Magician",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If the Magician is alive, the Storyteller chooses which Minion babysits Lil' Monsta. "],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:light_purple},"\n\n",{text:"Lil' Monsta",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/ ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Poppy Grower",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If Lil' Monsta & the Poppy Grower are alive, Minions wake one by one, until one of them chooses to take the Lil' Monsta token."],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:light_purple},"\n\n",{text:"Lil' Monsta",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/ ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Psychopath",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"If the Psychopath is babysitting Lil' Monsta, they die when executed."],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:light_purple},"\n\n",{text:"Lil' Monsta",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/ ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Scarlet Woman",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"If Lil' Monsta dies with 5 or more players alive, the Scarlet Woman babysits Lil' Monsta for the rest of the g